WEBVTT

00:03:29.669 --> 00:03:32.455
Everybody's got their different
ones that they like,

00:03:32.479 --> 00:03:35.119
but there's a big difference
between what you're good at

00:03:35.143 --> 00:03:38.554
and what you enjoy doing
or feel energized by.

00:03:38.578 --> 00:03:42.761
So it really does vary by person.

00:03:42.785 --> 00:03:45.413
In general, you can say
for lots of introverts,

00:03:45.437 --> 00:03:48.665
they prefer a one-on-one conversation.

00:03:48.689 --> 00:03:52.771
They prefer to direct
more of their social energy

00:03:52.795 --> 00:03:56.721
to family or to the people
who they know and love best.

00:03:56.745 --> 00:03:59.520
But then there's also
this subset of introverts

00:03:59.544 --> 00:04:01.369
who I discovered through my research